----------------------------------------------------------------------
Vehicle model
----------------------------------------------------------------------
Mass, dimensions and power-unit figures follow the 2025 FIA Formula One
Technical Regulations and publicly reported team figures. Aerodynamic and
tyre coefficients are NOT published by any team; those in this project are
fitted parameters chosen so the simulated limit lap matches real 2025 pole
times, and they should not be read as actual Red Bull Racing data.

This project is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or connected to Oracle Red
Bull Racing, Formula One, the FIA, or TypeSafe AI.
